        "ggFag0SyHPv_text": "<p>For best results, apply the serum twice daily—morning and night—after cleansing and before moisturizing.</p>",
        "gaRjC3FbZm9_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(247,253,250);color:rgb(26,26,26);font-size:16px;\">Yes, the formula is dermatologically tested and safe for all skin types, including sensitive and acne-prone skin.</span></p>",
        "gUNlCkSROcv_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(247,253,250);color:rgb(26,26,26);font-size:16px;\">Many users notice improved hydration and glow within the first week, with visible firming and smoothing in 4–6 weeks.</span></p>",
        "gP66e8Cuqr7_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(247,253,250);color:rgb(26,26,26);font-size:16px;\">Absolutely. Hydra Boost Serum enhances absorption, making it the perfect partner for your moisturizer, sunscreen, and other treatments.</span></p>"
